menu "VFO-Knob second chip"

config VFO_COMPANION_RELEASE
    bool "A release (tools/release.sh): the knob keeps it up to date by itself"
    default n
    help
        Set only by the release overlay (tools/release.sh, and the bench's
        test images built the same way), never by hand. The chip says so in
        its INFO frame; the knob replaces a release with a newer one by
        itself, and leaves a development build alone.

endmenu
